42
00:02:57,990 --> 00:03:11,096
Rym: So, I, uh, recently, and I posted it in the GeekNights forum, you can go read this thing two days ago, I recorded the stream we were watching of a hockey game, and I pulled it into Audition, and I did a little digging, and now you can see it right there in the spectrogram.

43
00:03:11,617 --> 00:03:18,595
