258
00:22:05,180 --> 00:22:08,426
Scott: And then, since then, I'm seeing a lot more people talk about this movie.

259
00:22:09,308 --> 00:22:13,555
Scott: It's about a guy who runs a shoe business, like a shoe factory.

260
00:22:13,615 --> 00:22:16,260
