00:31:08,845 --> 00:31:11,300
Scott: But yeah, it's still pretty good and useful.

352
00:31:11,624 --> 00:31:12,039
Scott: Pretty good?

353
00:31:12,843 --> 00:31:14,359
Scott: It's very useful, I'd say.

354
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:18,679
Rym: Very interesting, or perhaps remarkable, stellar exquisits.

