00:31:20,620 --> 00:31:25,240
Scott: Just take anything you've written, search for the word very, and replace all of them with something better.

356
00:31:25,560 --> 00:31:30,900
Rym: I appreciate that if I type very something into this, it just gets more and more superlative.

357
00:31:31,560 --> 00:31:34,920
Rym: It's definitely, the LLM is pretty well made for what it's doing.

